      {
        "id": "note-9ebacb3d-6835-4d2d-b8c0-2349f2bb6413",
        "kind": "note",
        "ownerId": null,
        "name": "",
        "documentation": "Trust boundary: LocalAuthentication returns a device-owner result; policy can use biometrics or passcode. UI entry is guarded. SwiftData already queries hidden records; controller/model methods have no auth check. No app-level encrypted vault, lifecycle relock, or per-operation authorization is implemented.",
        "properties": {
          "targetKind": "diagram",
          "targetId": null
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T17:46:32.634Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T18:50:49.201Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-007bd4c0-5762-471b-8863-0c186d893f38",
        "kind": "note",
        "ownerId": null,
        "name": "",
        "documentation": "Preferences enabling Hidden Group and editor toggling to hidden also authenticate; disabling/unhiding do not. Saving a hidden link through updateLink clears groups. Direct model mutation and toggleHideLink bypass that invariant. Turning off the preference alone does not reset an already selected hidden filter.",
        "properties": {
          "targetKind": "diagram",
          "targetId": null
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T17:46:32.634Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T18:50:49.201Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-78f36a11-27df-4d8e-9191-c91d88fc3a7c",
        "kind": "note",
        "ownerId": null,
        "name": "",
        "documentation": "If the hidden filter is already selected, tapping it toggles selection off without authentication. The button is absent when hiddenGroupActive is false. Disabling the preference does not itself reset filterHiddenSelected.",
        "properties": {
          "targetKind": "diagram",
          "targetId": null
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T17:53:18.632Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T18:50:49.201Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "note-a4fbea05-23d0-4d1a-9572-0c0af4a6fc98",
        "kind": "note",
        "ownerId": null,
        "name": "",
        "documentation": "NSFaceIDUsageDescription is supplied by project build settings in Debug and Release. It is purpose text for OS Face ID presentation, not an entitlement or authorization result. authenticateUser uses deviceOwnerAuthentication, which may also use passcode.",
        "properties": {
          "targetKind": "diagram",
          "targetId": null
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T18:50:49.201Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T18:50:49.201Z"
      }
    ],
